# Clerk publishable key (frontend, build-time). Copy this file to `.env` in
# this folder and fill in the key to enable Google sign-in via Clerk.
# Leave the key absent/empty to keep auth DISABLED — the app then runs fully
# public with no login wall, exactly as the public demo requires.
# Setup guide: docs/AUTH_CLERK.md in the repo root.
# VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...
